OL,3,GNEWSACocaine worth #1.6m seized from
OL,4,AGlasgow flat
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have seized cocaine worth about
OL,7,F#1.6m following the search of a Glasgow
OL,8,Fflat.
OL,10,FA 29-year-old man and a 21-year-old
OL,11,Fwoman were arrested and charged in
OL,12,Fconnection with drugs offences after
OL,13,Fpolice swooped on the city centre
OL,14,Fproperty about 20:00 on Tuesday.
OL,16,FThe search of the flat, on the city's
OL,17,FHolm Street, saw a significant quantity
OL,18,Fof cocaine recovered along with a
OL,19,Fsix-figure sum of money.
OL,21,FBoth of those arrested are to appear at
OL,22,FGlasgow Sheriff Court later.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
